  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-usage-lens",
      "text": "[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@yokesky/dsh-usage-lens)\n[](./LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/yokesky/dsh-usage-lens)\n\nDeepSeek Harness（DSH）Web UI 的**用量统计面板**，风格参考作者喜欢的 ZCode Harness 设计。\n安装后，设置面板会新增「用量统计」页面，直观展示你的使用情况。"
    },
    {
      "section": "预览",
      "text": "<img src=\"assets/demo.gif\" width=\"80%\" alt=\"dsh-usage-lens demo\" />\n\n<details>\n<summary>静态截图</summary>\n\n<img src=\"assets/preview/预览1.png\" width=\"90%\" alt=\"预览1\" />\n\n<img src=\"assets/preview/预览2.png\" width=\"90%\" alt=\"预览2\" />\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **总览卡片**：tokens 用量、会话数量、消息数量、活跃天数、当前连续天数、最常用模型。\n- **活跃热力图**：GitHub 风格的 280 天活跃热力图，一眼看清使用节奏。\n- **每日 Token 趋势**：按天查看 token 消耗，可切换「模型 / 厂商」视角。\n- **模型用量双环饼图**：支持「汇总 / 厂商 / 模型」三种查看方式。"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：npm 包",
      "text": "```sh\nnpm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh   # 先安装 dsh CLI，然后才能执行 dsh 命令\ndsh plugin --profile web add @yokesky/dsh-usage-lens\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：源码",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "需要已安装 dsh CLI（npm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh），如已装可跳过",
      "text": "git clone https://github.com/yokesky/dsh-usage-lens.git\ncd dsh-usage-lens\npnpm install\npnpm build\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:<本仓库绝对路径>\n```\n\n> 说明：`link:` 方式指向本地源码，修改代码后重新 `pnpm build` 并重启 web 服务即可生效，无需重新安装。也可以直接从本仓库路径安装：`dsh plugin --profile web add <本仓库路径>`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装后",
      "text": "重启 web 服务，打开设置面板即可看到「用量统计」。"
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "A usage statistics dashboard for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web UI. Once installed, a new **Usage Statistics** page appears in Settings.\n\n**Features:** overview cards (tokens, sessions, messages, active days, current streak, top model), a 280-day GitHub-style activity heatmap, a daily token trend chart with model/provider views, and a model-usage donut chart with summary/provider/model modes.\n\n**Install:**"
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "```sh\nnpm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh\ndsh plugin --profile web add @yokesky/dsh-usage-lens\n```\n\nRestart the web service, then open **Settings → Usage Statistics**."
    },
    {
      "section": "数据说明 / Privacy",
      "text": "- 所有数据来自你本机的 DSH 会话记录，只在本地处理，不会上传到任何地方。\n- 面板自动跟随 DSH 的亮色 / 暗色主题。\n\nAll data is read from your local DSH session logs and processed locally — nothing is uploaded. The panel follows DSH's light / dark theme automatically."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT © 2026 yokesky"
    }
